# LF in the index and in the working tree, whatever core.autocrlf says.
# Build tools (tauri-build, cargo) rewrite generated files such as
# app/src-tauri/Cargo.toml and permissions/autogenerated/*.toml with LF;
# with a CRLF working tree they showed up as modified after every build.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.msgpack binary
*.ttf binary
